  "title": "Bangers and Gnocchi with a Roasted Shallot and Cheese Sauce",
  "description": "Roasted sweet Italian sausage is served over a bed of pillowy gnocchi and smothered in a rich and creamy cheese sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Jose Napoleon Cuasay Artiaga I"
  ],
